{'symbol': 'ISRG', 'date': '2023-04-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'INTUITIVE RECEIVES FDA CLEARANCE OF DA VINCI SP FOR SIMPLE PROSTATECTOMY', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF., APRIL 28, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- INTUITIVE (NASDAQ: ISRG), A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER IN MINIMALLY INVASIVE CARE AND PIONEER OF ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY, ANNOUNCED THAT THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION RECENTLY CLEARED THE DA VINCI SP SURGICAL SYSTEM FOR SIMPLE PROSTATECTOMY AS A REPRESENTATIVE PROCEDURE, WHICH EXPANDS THE UROLOGIC SURGICAL PROCEDURES CLEARED BY FDA.'}